• Configure the WorkerPool. Click Creation Table and enter the data shown in the screenshot below.
Select the check box Get Job Orders at Home Only.
Change the Importer Services in the Entrance Control
10-340 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

• Program the Entrance Control. We typed in the source code below. It creates the local variable
servicesTable and gets the services table of the processing importer of the Station. It then checks
the names of the parts and writes the name of the service and the amount for that part into the
servicesTable. It finally sets the local variable servicesTable as the services table of the importer of the
Station.
The source code looks like this:
var servicesTable: table[string,integer,string]
Station.imp.getServices(servicesTable)
servicesTable.delete
switch @.Name
   case "PartA" 
       servicesTable.writeRow(1,1, "ServiceA",2)
   case "PartB" 
       servicesTable.writeRow(1,1, "ServiceB",1)
   case "PartC" 
       servicesTable.writeRow(1,1, "ServiceA",1)
       servicesTable.writeRow(1,2, "ServiceB",1)
end
Station.imp.setServices(servicesTable)
• When you click Apply, Plant Simulation show a message telling you that you have to activate the check
box Before Actions, if the instructions in the control are to apply to the active part.
• Run the simulation and watch what happens. To follow how the events are processed during the
simulation, you can click 
  in the EventController and then click 
  in the EventDebugger.
Compare the event list with the services which the Entrance Control entered into services table, which
the button 
  opens.
Change the Importer Services in the Entrance Control
